invariant: INV-36
file: build.zig
catches: test/host-builds.sh
reason: build.zig ignores HOST_TARGET and runs the host test on the target
  whatever the option says, so a check that sets the test's result on its
  command line, as it sets make's, builds a host object where make builds
  the device object. test/host-builds.sh requires -DHOST_TARGET= to give
  this host's TRUST=webpki object no -DCH_CPU_RUNTIME.

--- old
    const passed = if (config.host_target) |text| text.len != 0 else hostTarget(target);
--- new
    const passed = hostTarget(target);
